{
  "articles": [
    {
      "title": "2026最该搞懂的理财常识，越早知道越好",
      "thumb_media_id": "AePEmFk8ZwibHEAn_R1JIUxlyd2RUW_cvLDlAKqBs4j93l1YPIJr6MTD4iWAin3b",
      "content": "<div style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 40px 10px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; letter-spacing: 0.3px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">大家好，我是马尔斯，书灯笔记的主理人。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你有没有想过一个问题：为什么有些人收入不高，但日子过得挺滋润；有些人月薪好几万，却永远在焦虑钱不够花？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">不是因为前者更会赚钱。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">是因为他们跟钱的关系不一样。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">今天想跟你聊聊《金钱心理学》。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">01 理财成功的关键不是智商，是行为</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这本书的作者摩根·豪泽尔，是《华尔街日报》的专栏作家。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">他花了十几年研究一个问题：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">为什么聪明人也会在钱上犯蠢？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">他的结论很直接：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">理财成功跟智商的关系，远没有跟行为的关系大。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你不需要懂期权定价模型，不需要会看 K 线图，不需要知道什么是市盈率。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你需要的是——不在恐慌的时候卖出，不在贪婪的时候加杠杆，不把所有钱押在一件事情上。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">听起来很简单对吧？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但做起来太难了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">2008 年金融危机的时候，无数高学历的金融从业者亏得血本无归。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">不是因为他们不够聪明，是因为他们跟所有人一样——<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">在恐惧面前，理性会短路。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">豪泽尔说了一句很实在的话：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">&quot;投资不是一场智商测试，是一场行为测试。&quot;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你能控制的事情很少：市场涨跌、利率变化、经济周期——这些你管不了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你能控制的只有一件事：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">你自己的行为。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">什么时候买、什么时候卖、买多少、留多少现金——这些才是决定你财务状况的关键。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">02 复利：最被低估的力量</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这本书里反复出现的一个概念是复利。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">大家都知道复利的公式：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">1.</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">01 的 365 次方等于 37.</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">78。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 每天多存 1%，一年后你的存款会变成原来的 37 倍。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但豪泽尔讲的复利，不只是钱。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">时间也是复利。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 你每天花 30 分钟学一个新技能，一年后你比别人多出了 182 个小时。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">三年后，你可能已经靠这个技能接到了第一单副业。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">人际关系也是复利。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 你每天对身边的人好一点点，这些善意会累积。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">五年后，当你需要帮助的时候，你会发现有很多人愿意伸手。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">健康也是复利。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 你每天早睡半小时、少吃一顿外卖、多走一万步。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">短期内看不出差别，十年后，你的身体状态会跟同龄人拉开巨大差距。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">但复利有一个致命的敌人：中断。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你存了三年钱，突然取出来买了一辆车，复利归零。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你坚持健身两年，停了一个月，再捡起来就难了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你学英语学了半年，放下了，三个月后忘得一干二净。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">复利的秘诀不是&quot;多&quot;，是&quot;不停&quot;。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">豪泽尔说：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">&quot;好的投资不一定是高回报的，但一定是能让你坚持最久的。&quot;</strong></p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; \"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">03 足够：什么是真正的富有？</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这本书最后一章的标题叫&quot;足够&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">豪泽尔讲了一个故事。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">美国前总统罗纳德·里根的传记作者，在整理里根的遗物时发现：这位总统的存款，其实没有人们想象的那么多。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但里根从来不焦虑钱的问题。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">因为他觉得，自己已经拥有得足够了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">&quot;足够&quot;这个词，可能是理财世界里最被低估的概念。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我们从小被教育：要赚更多的钱，买更大的房子，开更好的车。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">没有人告诉我们：到什么时候可以停下来。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">于是我们一直在跑。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">月薪一万的时候想三万，三万的时候想五万，五万的时候想十万。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">跑着跑着就忘了，当初为什么要出发。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">豪泽尔说了一句让我想了很久的话：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">&quot;世界上最好的投资，是买回你自己的时间。&quot;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你赚更多的钱，不是为了买更多的东西，而是为了有权利说&quot;不&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">不加班，不做不喜欢的事，不跟不喜欢的人打交道。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">真正的富有，不是拥有很多，而是需要很少。</strong></p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">读完这本书，我做了一个简单的调整：把每月的存款目标从&quot;存多少&quot;改成了&quot;存够了就行&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">存够了之后的时间，用来做真正想做的事。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">钱是工具，不是目的。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">别把工具当成了主人。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">书灯笔记，用一本书，点亮一盏灯。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我是马尔斯，我们下期见。</p>\n</section>\n</div>",
      "author": "马尔斯",
      "digest": "理财成功的关键不是智商，是行为。《金钱心理学》告诉你：复利的秘诀不是多，是不停。真正的富有不是拥有很多，而是需要很少。",
